OL,3,GNEWSAGCHQ intern who took data home
OL,4,Aloses sentence appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GCHQ intern who was jailed for
OL,7,Fendangering national security by taking
OL,8,Ftop secret data home has lost a bid to
OL,9,Freduce his jail term.
OL,11,FManchester University computer science
OL,12,Fstudent Hasaan Arshad breached tight
OL,13,Fsecurity rules when he used his mobile
OL,14,Fphone to remove material from a
OL,15,Fcomputer system at GCHQ and transfer it
OL,16,Fto his private computer on 24 August
OL,17,F2022.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
