OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGCHQ intern who took data home
OL,4,Aloses sentence appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old was jailed for
OL,7,Fseven-and-a-half years after he
OL,8,Fadmitted an offence under the Computer
OL,9,FMisuse Act and two charges of making an
OL,10,Findecent photograph of a child.
OL,12,FOn Thursday Lady Justice Cockerill
OL,13,Frefused Arshad permission to challenge
OL,14,Fhis sentence, saying there were no
OL,15,Farguable grounds that the sentencing
OL,16,Fjudge was wrong.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
